@prefix bddo: <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#> .
@prefix hexplain: <https://hexplain.io/ns/core#> .
@prefix dlv: <https://hexplain.io/ns/dlv#> .
@prefix menc: <https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#> .
@prefix abnd: <https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/bundle#> .
@prefix conf: <https://hexplain.io/ns/conf#> .
@prefix req: <https://hexplain.io/ns/req#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/pp-layout-cell-type-first-forward#> .

ex:Root a bddo:Struct; bddo:hasField (ex:pixels).
ex:pixels a bddo:Field; bddo:dataType bddo:bytes; bddo:size 2; hexplain:hasDataLayout ex:Layout.
ex:Dim a dlv:Dimension; dlv:hasAxis dlv:axisX; dlv:dimensionSize 1.
ex:Layout a dlv:DataLayout; dlv:hasConditionalCellDataType ([ a dlv:CellDataTypeRule; bddo:condition "true"; dlv:ruleCellDataType bddo:uint16 ] [ a dlv:CellDataTypeRule; bddo:condition "true"; dlv:ruleCellDataType bddo:int16 ]); dlv:hasDimension (ex:Dim).
